# The error dialog for a game too big to start from the SD card
# (en_file_overflow, the longest dialog text with en_error_7): CLEAN BOOT,
# through the menu's test hook, of a GBA game just over 32 MB (Hello.gba
# padded). B closes it, and home comes back.
#! sd-file /Big.gba 0x2000004 tests/roms/hello/hello.gba
-w "nav: home ready"
-P "@8:nav_test_path:/Big.gba" -p @8:nav_test_action:1
-w "screen ready: dialog"
-s @1:dialog.png
-k @10:B -k @14:-
-w "nav: home ready"
-s @1:home.png
